  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Notification groups",
      "source_hash": 14803250997522624910,
      "context_hash": 17181646740413221476,
      "translation": "알림 그룹",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The **notification groups** are an easy way to help out with rustc in a \"piece-meal\" fashion, without committing to a larger project.",
      "source_hash": 2447610544236527481,
      "context_hash": 4436180463751477571,
      "translation": "**알림 그룹**은 더 큰 프로젝트에 전념하지 않고도 \"조금씩\" rustc를 도울 수 있는 쉬운 방법입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Notification groups are **[easy to join](#join)** (just submit a PR!) and joining does not entail any particular commitment.",
      "source_hash": 3853747431850149478,
      "context_hash": 18345767576443284663,
      "translation": "알림 그룹은 **[가입하기 쉬우며](#join)** (그저 PR을 제출하기만 하면 됩니다!) 가입한다고 해서 특별한 의무가 생기지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Once you [join a notification group](#join), you will be added to a list that receives pings on github whenever a new issue is found that fits the notification group's criteria.",
      "source_hash": 4959559052939211178,
      "context_hash": 17221158271144711504,
      "translation": "[알림 그룹에 가입하면](#join), 해당 알림 그룹의 기준에 맞는 새로운 이슈가 발견될 때마다 github에서 핑을 받는 목록에 추가됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If you are interested, you can then [claim the issue] and start working on it.",
      "source_hash": 14800571161804783370,
      "context_hash": 17236403827122626949,
      "translation": "관심이 있다면 [이슈를 맡아][claim the issue] 작업을 시작할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Of course, you don't have to wait for new issues to be tagged!",
      "source_hash": 14415322771900524773,
      "context_hash": 14832028163334042506,
      "translation": "물론 새로운 이슈에 태그가 붙기를 기다릴 필요는 없습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If you prefer, you can use the GitHub label for a notification group to search for existing issues that haven't been claimed yet.",
      "source_hash": 18196209457888833241,
      "context_hash": 9154253976981938452,
      "translation": "원한다면 알림 그룹의 GitHub 레이블을 사용하여 아직 맡겨지지 않은 기존 이슈를 검색할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:04:54.847898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
