    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Tagging an issue for a notification group",
      "source_hash": 17323748970568088715,
      "context_hash": 16661402469465819909,
      "translation": "알림 그룹을 위한 이슈 태그 지정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To tag an issue as appropriate for a notification group, you give [rustbot] a [`ping`] command with the name of the notification group.",
      "source_hash": 1145673137038940647,
      "context_hash": 14271982106732522841,
      "translation": "이슈를 알림 그룹에 적합하게 태그하려면, [rustbot]에게 알림 그룹의 이름과 함께 [`ping`] 명령을 내리십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 10481771741344712648,
      "translation": "예를 들면 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "To make some commands shorter and easier to remember, there are aliases, defined in the [`triagebot.toml`] file.",
      "source_hash": 11207416948414204129,
      "context_hash": 14418081102188369362,
      "translation": "일부 명령을 더 짧고 기억하기 쉽게 만들기 위해, [`triagebot.toml`] 파일에 정의된 별칭이 존재합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, all of these commands are equivalent and will ping the Apple group:",
      "source_hash": 10163605071024975362,
      "context_hash": 6941815371638929822,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 다음 명령들은 모두 동등하며 Apple 그룹에 핑을 보냅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512387Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Keep in mind that these aliases are meant to make humans' life easier.",
      "source_hash": 8574656470563513278,
      "context_hash": 16266024620400902600,
      "translation": "이러한 별칭은 사람들의 삶을 더 편하게 만들기 위한 것임을 유념하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512387Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "They might be subject to change.",
      "source_hash": 14739903587869461960,
      "context_hash": 6637406625162424213,
      "translation": "이는 변경될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512387Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "If you need to ensure that a command will always be valid, prefer the full invocations over the aliases.",
      "source_hash": 14110558202122297828,
      "context_hash": 2478445323781540856,
      "translation": "명령이 항상 유효하도록 보장해야 한다면, 별칭보다 전체 표현을 사용하는 것을 선호하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512387Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Note though that this should only be done by compiler team members or contributors, and is typically done as part of compiler team triage.**",
      "source_hash": 17140999454892032880,
      "context_hash": 2131341411982376100,
      "translation": "**다만 이는 컴파일러 팀 구성원이나 기여자만 수행해야 하며, 일반적으로 컴파일러 팀의 심사(triage) 과정의 일부로 수행됩니다.**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:03:51.512387Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
